3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,100
Bukan sejumput.

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:05,950
Sekarung.

5
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,000
Kebunnya memang lagi sakit.

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,300
Daun bawahnya kuning, patah menggantung.

7
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,900
Buahnya kecil-kecil.

8
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,800
Tetangga sebelahnya, Pak Karto,

9
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,000
