10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Kebunnya sama sakitnya.

11
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Hari pertama, dia bingung.

12
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,600
Hari ketiga, dia menghitung.

13
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,000
Tiga puluh pohon.

14
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Tiga puluh lingkaran.

15
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,300
Hari ketujuh, dia mencolek tanahnya.

16
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,300
Lalu menjilat.

17
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,900
Asin.

18
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,800
Malamnya dia cari di internet.

19
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,300
Semua jawabannya sama.

20
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,300
Garam itu dipakai buat membunuh rumput.

21
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,200
Besok subuh, dia lari ke kebun

22
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,600
