23
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,500
Pak Darman membaca.

24
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,400
Mengangguk.

25
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,800
Lalu lanjut menabur.

26
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,300
Garam di warung habis.

27
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:48,600
Ibu-ibu terpaksa masak tanpa garam.

28
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,000
Kabarnya menyebar.

29
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,300
Pak Darman sedang meracuni kebunnya sendiri.

30
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,600
Sebulan kemudian,

31
